# Force LF line endings for all text files so the git CRLF warnings stop
# blowing up the console on Windows checkouts. Native shell scripts and
# yaml stay LF; everything else normalised.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.m4a binary
*.mp3 binary
*.wav binary
